    <h2>Onboard <span>100</span><br>Businesses in 1 Year</h2>
    <p class="btc-hero-sub">Win 1,000,000 sats for every business you onboard · March 2026 – 2027</p>
    <p>Bitcoin Charlotte is on a mission to make Charlotte, NC the most Bitcoin-friendly city in the U.S. We're looking for passionate Bitcoiners to help onboard <strong>100 local businesses</strong> to accept Bitcoin payments. For every business you successfully onboard, you earn <strong>1,000,000 sats</strong>.</p>
  </section>

