  </section>

  <!-- ── Reward ── -->
  <section class="btc-reward">
    <div class="btc-reward-amount">1,000,000 sats</div>
    <div class="btc-reward-label">per business onboarded</div>
    <p>Rewards are paid to your on-chain Bitcoin address after verification. One payout per unique business.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── How to Earn ── -->
  <section id="how-to-earn">
    <h3>How to Earn Your Sats</h3>
    <div class="btc-steps">

      <div class="btc-step">
        <div class="btc-step-num">1</div>
        <h4>Onboard a Business</h4>
        <p>Walk into a local Charlotte business, show them how easy it is to accept Bitcoin, and help them get set up with a payment processor. See <a href="#how-to-onboard">How to Onboard a Business</a> below.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="btc-step">
        <div class="btc-step-num">2</div>
        <h4>Add to BTCMap.org</h4>
        <p>Tag the business on <a href="https://btcmap.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BTCMap.org</a> so the Bitcoin community can find it. Follow the <a href="https://wiki.btcmap.org/general/tagging-instructions.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">tagging guide</a> to add the correct OpenStreetMap tags.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="btc-step">
        <div class="btc-step-num">3</div>
        <h4>Submit Video Proof</h4>
        <p>Post your proof to our <a href="https://t.me/+0GOZLahvOPhlZmIx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Telegram chat</a>. Include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>📸 Photo of the business storefront</li>
          <li>📹 Short video of a Bitcoin payment being accepted</li>
          <li>📍 Business name and location</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Free <strong>"Bitcoin Accepted Here"</strong> stickers are available — ask in the <a href="https://t.me/+0GOZLahvOPhlZmIx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Telegram group</a>!</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Claim ── -->
  <section class="btc-claim">
    <p><strong>1,000,000 sats</strong> will be sent after we verify the business is live on BTCMap and your video proof checks out.</p>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:hodl@bitcoincharlotte.org?subject=Onboarding%20100%20Claim&body=Business%20Name%3A%0ABTCMap%20Link%3A%0ATelegram%20Proof%20Link%3A%0ABitcoin%20Address%3A">hodl@bitcoincharlotte.org</a> with your BTCMap link, proof link, and Bitcoin address to claim your sats.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── How to Onboard ── -->
  <section id="how-to-onboard">
    <h3>How to Onboard a Business</h3>
    <p>There are many ways for a business to accept Bitcoin. Here are the recommended payment processors — pick the one that best fits the business's existing setup.</p>

    <div class="btc-processors">

      <!-- Square -->
      <div class="btc-accordion btcpay">
        <div class="btc-accordion-trigger" onclick="btcToggle('acc-square')">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><rect width="64" height="64" rx="12" fill="#006AFF"/><rect x="18" y="18" width="28" height="28" rx="4" fill="#fff"/></svg>
          <span>Square</span>
          <span class="btc-badge">Recommended</span>
        </div>
        <div id="acc-square" class="btc-accordion-body" style="display:none;">
          <p>If the business already uses <strong>Square</strong>, they can enable Bitcoin acceptance in minutes — no extra hardware needed.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>📖 <a href="https://squareup.com/us/en/bitcoin" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Square Bitcoin Payments Guide</a></li>
            <li>📸 <a href="https://www.instagram.com/cashapp/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cash App Instagram</a> — for marketing inspiration</li>
            <li>📦 <a href="https://cash.app/bitcoin-marketing-kit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Square Bitcoin Marketing Kit</a></li>
          </ul>
          <div style="margin-top:1rem;position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;height:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:12px;">
            <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/HnOzE5nNegI" title="Square Bitcoin Setup" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;"></iframe>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- BTCPay Server -->
      <div class="btc-accordion btcpay">
        <div class="btc-accordion-trigger" onclick="btcToggle('acc-btcpay')">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="32" fill="#0f3b21"/><path d="M32 8l-6 12h12L32 8zm-10 18v12h20V26H22zm2 2h16v8H24v-8zm-4 14l10 14 10-14H20z" fill="#CEDC21"/></svg>
          <span>BTCPay Server</span>
          <span class="btc-badge" style="background:#4f46e5;">Recommended for Non-Square POS</span>
        </div>
        <div id="acc-btcpay" class="btc-accordion-body" style="display:none;">
          <p>BTCPay Server is a free, open-source, self-hosted Bitcoin payment processor. Bitcoin Charlotte runs a hosted instance for local businesses.</p>

          <h5>🧪 Try the Demo</h5>
          <p>See it in action at our demo store:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>🔗 <a href="https://btcpay316868.lndyn.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">btcpay316868.lndyn.com</a></li>
            <li>📧 Login: <code>pos@bitcoincharlotte.org</code></li>
            <li>🔑 Password: <code>bitcoinpos</code></li>
          </ul>

          <h5>⚙️ Setup for a Business</h5>
          <p>We use <strong>Strike</strong> for Lightning integration. The workflow:</p>
          <ol>
            <li>Business creates a <a href="https://strike.me" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Strike</a> account</li>
            <li>Business generates an API key in Strike settings</li>
            <li>We configure their BTCPay store with the Strike API key</li>
            <li>Payments arrive directly in the business's Strike wallet</li>
          </ol>

          <details>
            <summary>📧 Email Template for Business Owner</summary>
            <div style="background:#1a1a2e;padding:1rem;border-radius:8px;margin-top:0.5rem;">
              <p><em>Subject: Accept Bitcoin at [Business Name] — Free Setup</em></p>
              <p>Hi [Name],</p>
              <p>I'm a volunteer with Bitcoin Charlotte. We help local businesses accept Bitcoin payments at no cost. We handle all the technical setup — you just need a Strike account for receiving payments.</p>
              <p>Would you be open to a quick 10-minute demo?</p>
              <p>Best,<br>[Your Name]</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <p style="margin-top:1rem;">
            <a href="mailto:hodl@bitcoincharlotte.org?subject=BTCPay%20Setup%20Request&body=Business%20Name%3A%0AContact%20Name%3A%0APhone%2FEmail%3A%0A" class="btc-btn">📧 Email Us to Set Up a Store</a>
          </p>

          <p style="margin-top:1rem;font-size:0.85rem;opacity:0.7;">Want to self-host? Try <a href="https://www.lunanode.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LunaNode</a> or <a href="https://voltage.cloud/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Voltage</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Breez -->
      <div class="btc-accordion">
        <div class="btc-accordion-trigger" onclick="btcToggle('acc-breez')">
          <img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31890247?s=200&v=4" alt="Breez" width="28" height="28" style="border-radius:6px;">
          <span>Breez</span>
        </div>
        <div id="acc-breez" class="btc-accordion-body" style="display:none;">
          <p>Breez is a mobile Lightning wallet with a built-in point-of-sale mode — perfect for small vendors, farmers markets, and food trucks.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>🔗 <a href="https://breez.technology/mobile/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">breez.technology/mobile</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Alpaca -->
      <div class="btc-accordion">
        <div class="btc-accordion-trigger" onclick="btcToggle('acc-alpaca')">
          <img src="https://alpacarms.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/cropped-android-chrome-512x512-1-192x192.png" alt="Alpaca" width="28" height="28" style="border-radius:6px;">
          <span>Alpaca</span>
        </div>
        <div id="acc-alpaca" class="btc-accordion-body" style="display:none;">
          <p>Alpaca is a full-featured Bitcoin-native point-of-sale system with inventory management, invoicing, and more. Great for retail businesses that want a complete POS solution built around Bitcoin.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>🔗 <a href="https://alpacarms.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">alpacarms.com</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Zaprite -->
      <div class="btc-accordion">
        <div class="btc-accordion-trigger" onclick="btcToggle('acc-zaprite')">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6536aea2241f5765e3db6faa/6536aea2241f5765e3db6fca_zaprite-logo-icon.png" alt="Zaprite" width="28" height="28" style="border-radius:6px;">
          <span>Zaprite</span>
        </div>
        <div id="acc-zaprite" class="btc-accordion-body" style="display:none;">
          <p>Zaprite makes it easy to send invoices and get paid in Bitcoin. Ideal for service-based businesses, freelancers, and B2B.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>🔗 <a href="https://zaprite.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">zaprite.com</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- OpenNode -->
      <div class="btc-accordion">
        <div class="btc-accordion-trigger" onclick="btcToggle('acc-opennode')">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="32" fill="#0A66C2"/><path d="M32 16c-8.837 0-16 7.163-16 16s7.163 16 16 16 16-7.163 16-16-7.163-16-16-16zm0 28c-6.627 0-12-5.373-12-12s5.373-12 12-12 12 5.373 12 12-5.373 12-12 12z" fill="#fff"/><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="6" fill="#fff"/></svg>
          <span>OpenNode</span>
        </div>
        <div id="acc-opennode" class="btc-accordion-body" style="display:none;">
          <p>OpenNode provides Bitcoin payment processing with instant fiat conversion available. Good for businesses that want to dip their toes in without holding Bitcoin.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>🔗 <a href="https://www.opennode.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">opennode.com</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- IBEX -->
      <div class="btc-accordion">
        <div class="btc-accordion-trigger" onclick="btcToggle('acc-ibex')">
          <img src="https://www.poweredbyibex.io/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/ibex-logo.svg" alt="IBEX" width="28" height="28" style="border-radius:6px;background:#000;">
          <span>IBEX</span>
        </div>
        <div id="acc-ibex" class="btc-accordion-body" style="display:none;">
          <p>IBEX provides Bitcoin Lightning infrastructure for businesses, offering APIs and tools for payments.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>🔗 <a href="https://www.poweredbyibex.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">poweredbyibex.io</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Onboarding Resources ── -->
  <section>
    <h3>Onboarding Resources</h3>
    <ul class="btc-resources">
